A	captain|Captain Rosa
C	log_voyage	0	greet	Rosa asks about the voyage
N	greet						You took her out past the breakwater and back. Tell me how she handled.
O	history					How long have you kept the log?
O	steady					Steady. The patched hull held.
N	history		l	greet			Since my first command. Every boat out of this harbor has a page.
N	steady						Then it goes in the log as her first voyage. Write it plain.
C	log_signed	0	read	Rosa signs the log
N	read			sign			Good entry. Short, honest, and the date is right.
N	sign						Signed. She is a proper boat now, and you are in her book.
